{"seq":2,"slug":"gameobject-component","title":"GameObject 与组件系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-basics/gameobject-component","wordCount":984,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"gameobject-与组件系统\">GameObject 与组件系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Unity 的核心架构基于 GameObject-Component 模式：场景中的一切实体都是 GameObject，而 GameObject 本身只是一个空容器，其行为和表现完全由挂载的组件（Component）决定。这种组合优于继承的设计理念，是 Unity 区别于传统面向对象游戏引擎的关键特征。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph GameObject 组件架构&#10;        GO[GameObject] --&gt; T[Transform]&#10;        GO --&gt; R[Renderer]&#10;        GO --&gt; C[Collider]&#10;        GO --&gt; S[Script 自定义脚本]&#10;        GO --&gt; A[AudioSource]&#10;    end&#10;    T --&gt; P[位置/旋转/缩放]&#10;    R --&gt; M[网格/材质渲染]&#10;    C --&gt; PH[物理碰撞检测]&#10;    S --&gt; L[游戏逻辑]&#10;    A --&gt; SD[音频播放]\">graph TB\n    subgraph GameObject 组件架构\n        GO[GameObject] --&gt; T[Transform]\n        GO --&gt; R[Renderer]\n        GO --&gt; C[Collider]\n        GO --&gt; S[Script 自定义脚本]\n        GO --&gt; A[AudioSource]\n    end\n    T --&gt; P[位置/旋转/缩放]\n    R --&gt; M[网格/材质渲染]\n    C --&gt; PH[物理碰撞检测]\n    S --&gt; L[游戏逻辑]\n    A --&gt; SD[音频播放]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>继承模式</th>\n<th>组件模式 (Unity)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>行为复用</td>\n<td>通过类继承链</td>\n<td>组件自由组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>受限于继承层级</td>\n<td>运行时动态增删</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>耦合度</td>\n<td>高，父类修改影响所有子类</td>\n<td>低，组件间松耦合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型问题</td>\n<td>菱形继承、类爆炸</td>\n<td>组件间通信需设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码复用</td>\n<td>垂直复用</td>\n<td>水平复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多态性</td>\n<td>隐式（继承链）</td>\n<td>显式（接口实现）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gameobject-生命周期与层级关系\">GameObject 生命周期与层级关系</h2><p>GameObject 在 Unity 中存在明确的生命周期：创建（Instantiate）→ 激活（SetActive）→ 存活 → 停用 → 销毁（Destroy）。通过 Hierarchy 面板可以建立父子关系，子对象的 Transform 受父对象影响。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;public class GameObjectLifecycle : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private GameObject enemyPrefab;&#10;&#10;    public GameObject SpawnEnemy(Vector3 position)&#10;    {&#10;        GameObject enemy = Instantiate(enemyPrefab, position, Quaternion.identity);&#10;        enemy.name = &quot;Enemy_&quot; + Time.frameCount;&#10;        enemy.transform.SetParent(transform);&#10;        return enemy;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void DeactivateEnemy(GameObject enemy)&#10;    {&#10;        enemy.SetActive(false);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void DestroyEnemy(GameObject enemy)&#10;    {&#10;        Destroy(enemy, 0.5f);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class GameObjectLifecycle : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private GameObject enemyPrefab;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public GameObject SpawnEnemy(Vector3 position)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameObject enemy = Instantiate(enemyPrefab, position, Quaternion.identity);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        enemy.name = \"Enemy_\" + Time.frameCount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        enemy.transform.SetParent(transform);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return enemy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void DeactivateEnemy(GameObject enemy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        enemy.SetActive(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void DestroyEnemy(GameObject enemy)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Destroy(enemy, 0.5f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>父子关系是 Unity 场景组织的基础。子对象的世界坐标由父对象的 Transform 叠加自身本地 Transform 计算得出。修改父对象的位置、旋转或缩放会自动级联到所有子对象。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>设置父对象</td>\n<td><code>SetParent(parent)</code></td>\n<td>worldPositionStays 默认 true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保持本地坐标</td>\n<td><code>SetParent(parent, false)</code></td>\n<td>不调整本地坐标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解除父子关系</td>\n<td><code>SetParent(null)</code></td>\n<td>变为根对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查找子对象</td>\n<td><code>Find(&quot;ChildName&quot;)</code></td>\n<td>只搜索直接子对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遍历所有子对象</td>\n<td><code>GetComponentsInChildren&lt;T&gt;()</code></td>\n<td>递归搜索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;public class HierarchyManager : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    public void ReparentAll(Transform newParent)&#10;    {&#10;        while (transform.childCount &gt; 0)&#10;        {&#10;            transform.GetChild(0).SetParent(newParent, true);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public T FindInChildren&lt;T&gt;(string objectName) where T : Component&#10;    {&#10;        Transform child = transform.Find(objectName);&#10;        return child != null ? child.GetComponent&lt;T&gt;() : null;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class HierarchyManager : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void ReparentAll(Transform newParent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (transform.childCount > 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            transform.GetChild(0).SetParent(newParent, true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public T FindInChildren&#x3C;T>(string objectName) where T : Component</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Transform child = transform.Find(objectName);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return child != null ? child.GetComponent&#x3C;T>() : null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"内置组件体系\">内置组件体系</h2><p>Unity 提供了丰富的内置组件，覆盖渲染、物理、音频、UI 等各个子系统。这些组件经过高度优化，是构建游戏功能的基础积木。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 内置组件分类&#10;        A[渲染组件] --&gt; A1[MeshRenderer]&#10;        A --&gt; A2[SpriteRenderer]&#10;        A --&gt; A3[Camera]&#10;        A --&gt; A4[Light]&#10;        B[物理组件] --&gt; B1[Rigidbody]&#10;        B --&gt; B2[Collider]&#10;        B --&gt; B3[Joint]&#10;        C[音频组件] --&gt; C1[AudioSource]&#10;        C --&gt; C2[AudioListener]&#10;        D[UI 组件] --&gt; D1[Canvas]&#10;        D --&gt; D2[Text/Image]&#10;        D --&gt; D3[Button]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 内置组件分类\n        A[渲染组件] --&gt; A1[MeshRenderer]\n        A --&gt; A2[SpriteRenderer]\n        A --&gt; A3[Camera]\n        A --&gt; A4[Light]\n        B[物理组件] --&gt; B1[Rigidbody]\n        B --&gt; B2[Collider]\n        B --&gt; B3[Joint]\n        C[音频组件] --&gt; C1[AudioSource]\n        C --&gt; C2[AudioListener]\n        D[UI 组件] --&gt; D1[Canvas]\n        D --&gt; D2[Text/Image]\n        D --&gt; D3[Button]\n    end</pre><p>渲染组件决定 GameObject 的视觉表现。MeshRenderer 配合 MeshFilter 渲染 3D 模型，SpriteRenderer 用于 2D 精灵，Camera 定义视角，Light 提供光照。</p>\n<p>物理组件赋予 GameObject 物理行为。Rigidbody 让对象参与物理模拟，Collider 定义碰撞形状，两者配合实现真实的物理交互。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;public class PhysicsSetup : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    public void ConfigurePhysicsObject(GameObject target)&#10;    {&#10;        var rb = target.GetComponent&lt;Rigidbody&gt;();&#10;        if (rb == null)&#10;            rb = target.AddComponent&lt;Rigidbody&gt;();&#10;&#10;        rb.mass = 5f;&#10;        rb.linearDamping = 0.5f;&#10;        rb.angularDamping = 0.1f;&#10;        rb.useGravity = true;&#10;        rb.collisionDetectionMode = CollisionDetectionMode.Continuous;&#10;&#10;        var col = target.GetComponent&lt;BoxCollider&gt;();&#10;        if (col == null)&#10;            col = target.AddComponent&lt;BoxCollider&gt;();&#10;&#10;        col.center = Vector3.zero;&#10;        col.size = Vector3.one;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class PhysicsSetup : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void ConfigurePhysicsObject(GameObject target)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var rb = target.GetComponent&#x3C;Rigidbody>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (rb == null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            rb = target.AddComponent&#x3C;Rigidbody>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        rb.mass = 5f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        rb.linearDamping = 0.5f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        rb.angularDamping = 0.1f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        rb.useGravity = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        rb.collisionDetectionMode = CollisionDetectionMode.Continuous;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var col = target.GetComponent&#x3C;BoxCollider>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (col == null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            col = target.AddComponent&#x3C;BoxCollider>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        col.center = Vector3.zero;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        col.size = Vector3.one;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"组件通信模式\">组件通信模式</h2><p>组件之间的通信是 Unity 开发中的核心设计问题。直接引用、GetComponent 查询、事件系统和 ScriptableObject 是四种主要的通信方式，各有适用场景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通信方式</th>\n<th>耦合度</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接引用 (SerializeField)</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n<td>同对象或父子组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GetComponent()</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>较快(缓存后)</td>\n<td>同对象不同组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SendMessage</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>慢(反射)</td>\n<td>不推荐使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UnityEvent</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>Inspector 可配置的回调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接口 + GetComponent</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>较快</td>\n<td>多态组件交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ScriptableObject 事件</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>跨场景/全局事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;public interface IDamageable&#10;{&#10;    void TakeDamage(float amount);&#10;    float CurrentHealth { get; }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class HealthSystem : MonoBehaviour, IDamageable&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private float maxHealth = 100f;&#10;    private float currentHealth;&#10;&#10;    public float CurrentHealth =&gt; currentHealth;&#10;&#10;    private void Awake()&#10;    {&#10;        currentHealth = maxHealth;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void TakeDamage(float amount)&#10;    {&#10;        currentHealth = Mathf.Max(0, currentHealth - amount);&#10;        if (currentHealth &lt;= 0)&#10;            HandleDeath();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private void HandleDeath()&#10;    {&#10;        Destroy(gameObject, 0.1f);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class Weapon : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private float damage = 25f;&#10;&#10;    public void Attack(Collider target)&#10;    {&#10;        if (target.TryGetComponent&lt;IDamageable&gt;(out var damageable))&#10;        {&#10;            damageable.TakeDamage(damage);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public interface IDamageable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    void TakeDamage(float amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float CurrentHealth { get; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class HealthSystem : MonoBehaviour, IDamageable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float maxHealth = 100f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float currentHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float CurrentHealth => currentHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void Awake()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentHealth = maxHealth;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void TakeDamage(float amount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentHealth = Mathf.Max(0, currentHealth - amount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (currentHealth &#x3C;= 0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            HandleDeath();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void HandleDeath()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Destroy(gameObject, 0.1f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class Weapon : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private float damage = 25f;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Attack(Collider target)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (target.TryGetComponent&#x3C;IDamageable>(out var damageable))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            damageable.TakeDamage(damage);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>TryGetComponent</code> 是 Unity 2019.2+ 引入的方法，相比 <code>GetComponent</code> 不会在组件不存在时产生 GC 分配，是组件查询的最佳实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tag-layer-与对象查找\">Tag、Layer 与对象查找</h2><p>Unity 提供 Tag 和 Layer 两种标记机制用于对象分类。Tag 是字符串标识，用于逻辑层面的对象查找；Layer 是位掩码，用于物理碰撞和渲染过滤。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>查找方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Tag</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>逻辑分类标识</td>\n<td>FindWithTag / CompareTag</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Layer</td>\n<td>int (位掩码)</td>\n<td>物理/渲染过滤</td>\n<td>LayerMask 位运算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Name</td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>场景内唯一标识</td>\n<td>Find (不推荐运行时)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Type</td>\n<td>System.Type</td>\n<td>按组件类型查找</td>\n<td>FindObjectOfType</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"using UnityEngine;&#10;&#10;public class ObjectFinder : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    [SerializeField] private LayerMask enemyLayer;&#10;&#10;    public GameObject FindNearestEnemy(Vector3 position, float radius)&#10;    {&#10;        Collider[] hits = Physics.OverlapSphere(position, radius, enemyLayer);&#10;        GameObject nearest = null;&#10;        float minDist = float.MaxValue;&#10;&#10;        foreach (var hit in hits)&#10;        {&#10;            if (!hit.CompareTag(&quot;Enemy&quot;)) continue;&#10;&#10;            float dist = Vector3.Distance(position, hit.transform.position);&#10;            if (dist &lt; minDist)&#10;            {&#10;                minDist = dist;&#10;                nearest = hit.gameObject;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        return nearest;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using UnityEngine;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class ObjectFinder : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [SerializeField] private LayerMask enemyLayer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public GameObject FindNearestEnemy(Vector3 position, float radius)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Collider[] hits = Physics.OverlapSphere(position, radius, enemyLayer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        GameObject nearest = null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float minDist = float.MaxValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        foreach (var hit in hits)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (!hit.CompareTag(\"Enemy\")) continue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            float dist = Vector3.Distance(position, hit.transform.position);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (dist &#x3C; minDist)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                minDist = dist;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                nearest = hit.gameObject;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return nearest;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用 <code>CompareTag</code> 而非 <code>== &quot;Tag&quot;</code> 进行标签比较，前者不产生字符串分配，性能更优。避免在 Update 中调用 <code>Find</code> 系列方法，应在 Awake/Start 中缓存引用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((GameObject 与组件))&#10;    核心架构&#10;      组合优于继承&#10;      组件自由组合&#10;      运行时动态增删&#10;    生命周期&#10;      创建与销毁&#10;      激活与停用&#10;      父子层级关系&#10;    内置组件&#10;      渲染组件&#10;      物理组件&#10;      音频组件&#10;      UI 组件&#10;    组件通信&#10;      直接引用&#10;      接口模式&#10;      TryGetComponent&#10;      事件驱动&#10;    对象标记&#10;      Tag 标签&#10;      Layer 层级&#10;      缓存查找结果\">mindmap\n  root((GameObject 与组件))\n    核心架构\n      组合优于继承\n      组件自由组合\n      运行时动态增删\n    生命周期\n      创建与销毁\n      激活与停用\n      父子层级关系\n    内置组件\n      渲染组件\n      物理组件\n      音频组件\n      UI 组件\n    组件通信\n      直接引用\n      接口模式\n      TryGetComponent\n      事件驱动\n    对象标记\n      Tag 标签\n      Layer 层级\n      缓存查找结果</pre><ul>\n<li>Unity 采用 GameObject-Component 架构，组合优于继承是核心设计理念</li>\n<li>GameObject 本身只是容器，所有功能由挂载的 Component 提供</li>\n<li>父子层级关系影响 Transform 级联计算，是场景组织的基础</li>\n<li>内置组件覆盖渲染、物理、音频、UI 四大子系统</li>\n<li>组件通信推荐使用接口 + TryGetComponent 模式，避免 SendMessage</li>\n<li>Tag 用于逻辑分类，Layer 用于物理/渲染过滤，运行时应缓存查找结果</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GameObject 与组件系统","id":"gameobject-与组件系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GameObject 生命周期与层级关系","id":"gameobject-生命周期与层级关系"},{"level":2,"text":"内置组件体系","id":"内置组件体系"},{"level":2,"text":"组件通信模式","id":"组件通信模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Tag、Layer 与对象查找","id":"tag-layer-与对象查找"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Unity 编辑器概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-basics/unity-editor-overview"},"next":{"title":"坐标系统与 Transform","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unity-development/unity-basics/coordinate-and-transform"}}